<title>USA: USDA year-to-date livestock slaughter.</title>
<headline>USDA year-to-date livestock slaughter.</headline>
<text>
<p>Est weekly and year to date livestock slaughter - USDA</p>
<p>					   CATTLE     CALVES	 HOGS</p>
<p>Friday     01/03/97  (est)	128,000	6,000     365,000</p>
<p>Saturday   01/04/97  (est)	 86,000	    0	69,000</p>
<p>Week ago (est)			101,000	    0     173,000</p>
<p>Year ago (act)			 79,000	    0     152,000</p>
<p>Week to date (est)		  574,000     26,000   1,483,000</p>
<p>Same Period Last Week (est)     528,000     26,000   1,404,000</p>
<p>Same Period Last Year* (act)    604,000     28,000   1,618,000</p>
<p>1997 Year to date		   337,000     13,000     799,000</p>
<p>1996 Year to date*		  604,000     28,000   1,618,000</p>
<p>Percent change			  -44.2%     -53.7%     -50.6%</p>
<p>*1996 totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions.</p>
<p>1997 Totals are subject to revision.</p>
<p>Yearly totals may not add due to rounding.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
</text>
